 the curve $y=- x^{3} - 2$ at the point $(-2,6)$ intersects the $x$-axis.\n\nThe intersection is $(${{field-1}}$,$ {{field-2}}$)$. Give exact values."] [:db/add "0cba6238-50e1-5517-b2db-db34353f266c" :question/worked-solution "Differentiate the polynomial.\n\n$$\nf'(x)=- 3 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the tangent slope and take its negative reciprocal to find the normal slope.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nm_t=f'(-2)&=- 3 (-2)^{2}=-12, \\\\m_n=-\\frac{1}{m_t}&=-\\frac{1}{(-12)}=\\frac{1}{12}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse point-slope form through $(-2,6)$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny-(6)&=\\frac{1}{12}(x-(-2)), \\\\y&=\\frac{x}{12} + \\frac{37}{6}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt the $x$-axis, $y=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n0&=\\frac{1}{12}x+\\left(\\frac{37}{6}\\right), \\\\x&=-74.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe intersection is $(-74,0)$."] [:db/add "0cba6238-50e1-5517-b2db-db34353f266c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "0cba6238-50e1-5517-b2db-db34353f266c" :question/answer-fields "3fa18823-6841-58c1-8903-4418f2f653a3"] [:db/add "0cba6238-50e1-5517-b2db-db34353f266c" :question/answer-fields "c56a77d0-052f-5449-a5bb-8d75cc121f68"] [:db/ensure "0cba6238-50e1-5517-b2db-db34353f266c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186092385 :knowledge-point/questions "0cba6238-50e1-5517-b2db-db34353f266c"] [:db/add "815aad16-169f-5936-81bf-883744e479f2" :answer/id #uuid "815aad16-169f-5936-81bf-883744e479f2"] [:db/add "815aad16-169f-5936-81bf-883744e479f2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "815aad16-169f-5936-81bf-883744e479f2" :answer/value "0"] [:db/ensure "815aad16-169f-5936-81bf-883744e479f2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "bc3687ac-c41f-5fc9-bec4-884f6ff6d6ad" :answer-field/id #uuid "bc3687ac-c41f-5fc9-bec4-884f6ff6d6ad"] [:db/add "bc3687ac-c41f-5fc9-bec4-884f6ff6d6ad" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "bc3687ac-c41f-5fc9-bec4-884f6ff6d6ad" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "bc3687ac-c41f-5fc9-bec4-884f6ff6d6ad" :answer-field/choices "815aad16-169f-5