$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny&=\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 0+\\left(\\frac{5}{4}\\right), \\\\y&=\\frac{5}{4}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe intersection is $\\left(0,\\frac{5}{4}\\right)$."] [:db/add "dd8f16fa-3a03-59f6-bdb6-8a72198b67ca" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "dd8f16fa-3a03-59f6-bdb6-8a72198b67ca" :question/answer-fields "bc3687ac-c41f-5fc9-bec4-884f6ff6d6ad"] [:db/add "dd8f16fa-3a03-59f6-bdb6-8a72198b67ca" :question/answer-fields "1f12bb4e-84e1-569d-ab3a-1953520db9a7"] [:db/ensure "dd8f16fa-3a03-59f6-bdb6-8a72198b67ca" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186092385 :knowledge-point/questions "dd8f16fa-3a03-59f6-bdb6-8a72198b67ca"] [:db/add "4e4857bf-47c6-5af0-84f9-efb558b31751" :answer/id #uuid "4e4857bf-47c6-5af0-84f9-efb558b31751"] [:db/add "4e4857bf-47c6-5af0-84f9-efb558b31751" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4e4857bf-47c6-5af0-84f9-efb558b31751" :answer/value "0"] [:db/ensure "4e4857bf-47c6-5af0-84f9-efb558b31751" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ed427479-c27b-5c4f-9f2e-b85103a8e110" :answer-field/id #uuid "ed427479-c27b-5c4f-9f2e-b85103a8e110"] [:db/add "ed427479-c27b-5c4f-9f2e-b85103a8e110" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "ed427479-c27b-5c4f-9f2e-b85103a8e110" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "ed427479-c27b-5c4f-9f2e-b85103a8e110" :answer-field/choices "4e4857bf-47c6-5af0-84f9-efb558b31751"] [:db/add "ed427479-c27b-5c4f-9f2e-b85103a8e110" :answer-field/correct "4e4857bf-47c6-5af0-84f9-efb558b31751"] [:db/ensure "ed427479-c27b-5c4f-9f2e-b85103a8e110" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1bfec566-5506-57ee-a0ed-52b9dc2535a4" :answer/id #uuid "1bfec566-5506-57ee-a0ed-52b9dc2535a4"] [:db/add "1bfec566-5506-57ee-a0ed-52b9dc2535a4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1bfec566-5506-57ee-a0ed-52b9dc2535a4" :answer/value "- \\frac{49}{6}"] [:db/ensure "1bfec566-5506-57ee-a0ed-52b9dc2535a4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "baa8b54f-a09f-54a2-9584-b6acd67c06e4" :answer-field/id #uuid "baa8b54f-a09f-54a2-9584-b6acd67c06e4"] [:db/add "baa8b54f-a09f-54a2-9584-b6acd67c06e4" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "baa8b54f-a09f-54a2-9584-b6acd67c06e4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "baa8b54f-a09f-54a2-9584-b6acd67c06e4" :answer-field/choices "1bfec566-5506-57ee-a0ed-52b9dc2535a4"] [:db/add "baa8b54f-a09f-54a2-9584-b6acd67c06e4" :answer-field/correct "1bfec566-5506-57ee-a0ed-52b9dc2535a4"] [:db/ensure "baa8b54f-a09f-54a2-9584-b6acd67c06e4" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "4c3524ba-b0c4-57eb-a5af-8fdcd294e9d5" :question/id #uuid "4c3524ba-b0c4-57eb-a5af-8fdcd294e9d5"] [:db/add "4c3524ba-b0c4-57eb-a5af-8fdcd294e9d5" :question/problem "Find where the normal line to the curve $y=x^{3}$ at the point $(-2,-8)$ intersects the $y$-axis.\n\nThe intersection is $(${{field-1}}$,$ {{field-2}}$)$. Give exact values."] [:db/add "4c3524ba-b0c4-57eb-a5af-8fdcd294e9d5" :question/worked-solution "Differentiate the polynomial.\n\n$$\nf'(x)=3 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the tangent slope and take its negative reciprocal to find the normal slope.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nm_t=f'(-2)&=3 (-2)^{2}=12, \\\\m_n=-\\frac{1}{m_t}&=-\\frac{1}{(12)}=- \\frac{1}{12}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse point-slope form through $(-2,-8)$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny-(-8)&=- \\frac{1}{12}(x-(-2)), \\\\y&=- \\frac{x}{12} - \\frac{49}{6}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt the $y$-axis, $x=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny&=- \\frac{1}{12}\\cdot 0+\\left(- \\frac{49}{6}\\right), \\\\y&=- \\frac{49}{6}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe intersection is $\\left(0,- \\frac{49}{6}\\right)$."] [:db/add "4c3524ba-b0c4-57eb-a5af-8fdcd294e9d5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "4c3524ba-b0c4-57eb-a5af-8fdcd294e9d5" :question/answer-fields "ed427479-c27b-5c4f-9f2e-b85103a8e110"] [:db/add "4c3524ba-b0c4-57eb-a5af-8fdcd294e9d5" :question/answer-fields "baa8b54f-a09f-54a2-9584-b6acd67c06e4"] [:db/ensure "4c3524ba-b0c4-57eb-a5af-8fdcd294e9d5" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186092385 :knowledge-point/questions "4c3524ba-