nd where the normal line to the curve $y=2 x^{2} - x + 1$ at the point $(1,2)$ intersects the $x$-axis.\n\nThe intersection is $(${{field-1}}$,$ {{field-2}}$)$. Give exact values."] [:db/add "39f3ae23-63d4-5c5b-8855-fdec4ed01ee4" :question/worked-solution "Differentiate the polynomial.\n\n$$\nf'(x)=4 x - 1.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the tangent slope and take its negative reciprocal to find the normal slope.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nm_t=f'(1)&=4 (1) - 1=3, \\\\m_n=-\\frac{1}{m_t}&=-\\frac{1}{(3)}=- \\frac{1}{3}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse point-slope form through $(1,2)$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny-(2)&=- \\frac{1}{3}(x-(1)), \\\\y&=- \\frac{x}{3} + \\frac{7}{3}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt the $x$-axis, $y=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n0&=- \\frac{1}{3}x+\\left(\\frac{7}{3}\\right), \\\\x&=7.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe intersection is $(7,0)$."] [:db/add "39f3ae23-63d4-5c5b-8855-fdec4ed01ee4" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "39f3ae23-63d4-5c5b-8855-fdec4ed01ee4" :question/answer-fields "06ddab4c-743b-5b5b-a660-428a0141d9c0"] [:db/add "39f3ae23-63d4-5c5b-8855-fdec4ed01ee4" :question/answer-fields "5c7a8041-d7f3-55cd-aa48-77f57c91e53a"] [:db/ensure "39f3ae23-63d4-5c5b-8855-fdec4ed01ee4" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186092385 :knowledge-point/questions "39f3ae23-63d4-5c5b-8855-fdec4ed01ee4"] [:db/add "581eda30-9775-545c-ba85-b85f3a8e87ed" :answer/id #uuid "581eda30-9775-545c-ba85-b85f3a8e87ed"] [:db/add "581eda30-9775-545c-ba85-b85f3a8e87ed" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "581eda30-9775-545c-ba85-b85f3a8e87ed" :answer/value "74"] [:db/ensure "581eda30-9775-545c-ba85-b85f3a8e87ed" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c1c9df5b-33b5-51ea-8991-5a863492e8a7" :answer-field/id #uuid "c1c9df5b-33b5-51ea-8991-5a863492e8a7"] [:db/add "c1c9df5b-33b5-51ea-8991-5a863492e8a7" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "c1c9df5b-33b5-51ea-8991-5a863492e8a7" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c1c9df5b-33b5-51ea-8991-5a863492e8a7" :answer-field/choices "581eda30-9775-545c-ba85-b85f3a8e87ed"] [:db/add "c1c9df5b-33b5-51ea-8991-5a863492e8a7" :answer-field/correct "581eda30-9775-545c-ba85-b85f3a8e87ed"] [:db/ensure "c1c9df5b-33b5-51ea-8991-5a863492e8a7" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "ab6e82c6-26a1-5e86-ae46-b752b1151d5d" :answer/id #uuid "ab6e82c6-26a1-5e86-ae46-b752b1151d5d"] [:db/add "ab6e82c6-26a1-5e86-ae46-b752b1151d5d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ab6e82c6-26a1-5e86-ae46-b752b1151d5d" :answer/value "0"] [:db/ensure "ab6e82c6-26a1-5e86-ae46-b752b1151d5d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9d215418-624c-5608-922d-ee9779dedc48" :answer-field/id #uuid "9d215418-624c-5608-922d-ee9779dedc48"] [:db/add "9d215418-624c-5608-922d-ee9779dedc48" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "9d215418-624c-5608-922d-ee9779dedc48" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "9d215418-624c-5608-922d-ee9779dedc48" :answer-field/choices "ab6e82c6-26a1-5e86-ae46-b752b1151d5d"] [:db/add "9d215418-624c-5608-922d-ee9779dedc48" :answer-field/correct "ab6e82c6-26a1-5e86-ae46-b752b1151d5d"] [:db/ensure "9d215418-624c-5608-922d-ee9779dedc48" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "3e0890f0-4c78-597b-b788-57126909620b" :question/id #uuid "3e0890f0-4c78-597b-b788-57126909620b"] [:db/add "3e0890f0-4c78-597b-b788-57126909620b" :question/problem "Find where the normal line to the curve $y=x^{3} - 2$ at the point $(2,6)$ intersects the $x$-axis.\n\nThe intersection is $(${{field-1}}$,$ {{field-2}}$)$. Give exact values."] [:db/add "3e0890f0-4c78-597b-b788-57126909620b" :question/worked-solution "Differentiate the polynomial.\n\n$$\nf'(x)=3 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the tangent slope and take its negative reciprocal to find the normal slope.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nm_t=f'(2)&=3 (2)^{2}=12, \\\\m_n=-\\frac{1}{m_t}&=-\\frac{1}{(12)}=- \\frac{1}{12}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse point-slope form through $(2,6)$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny-(6)&=- \\frac{1}{12}(x-(2)), \\\\y&=- \\frac{x}{12} + \\frac{37}{6}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt the $x$-axis, $y=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n0&=- \\frac{1}{12}x+\\left(\\frac{37}{6}\\right), \\\\x&=74.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe intersection is $(74,0)$."] [:db/add "3e0890f0-4c78-597b-b788-57126909620b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "3e0890f0-4c78-597b-b788-57126909620b" :question/answer-fields "c1c9df5b-33b5-51ea-8991-5a863492e8a7"] [:db/add "3e0890f0-4c78-597b-b788-57126909620b" :question/answer-fields "9d215418-624c-5608-922d-ee9779dedc48"] [:db/ensure "3e0890f0-4c78-597b-b788-57126909620b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186092385 :knowledge-point/questions "3e0890f0-4c78-597b-b788-57126909620b"] [:db/ensure 17592186092385 :knowledge-point/validate]]
